        {
          "title": "See it is set",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>Watch video from</strong> then shows only the host and port. Your user name and password stay in ATAK's video list.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1044b51e7fd02b03.webp",
